---
const title = "Widgets that fit";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A demo site for the beacon Astro example." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>{title}</h1>
      <p>
        Run <code>pnpm build</code> and a <code>.md</code> twin appears next to
        every page in <code>dist</code>. The middleware serves it when a client
        negotiates for it.
      </p>
      <h2>Why twins</h2>
      <p>
        An AI client reading HTML spends most of its context on markup it will
        throw away. The twin is the same content without the chrome.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
